url: "https://ammarhsufyan.github.io/no-free-alpha/"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end, cost-aware evaluation of the trading strategies offered to retail crypto investors in 2026:
  technical-indicator bots, Freqtrade community strategies, an LLM (Claude) trading agent, copy trading of
  Hyperliquid wallets selected by four finders (including a skill finder using block-bootstrap tests,
  Benjamini-Hochberg false-discovery-rate control and empirical-Bayes shrinkage) replayed walk-forward on the
  complete public fill ledger (457 days, 1.5 million wallets), and a daily trend rotation with a survivorship-free
  universe. After fees and slippage, no strategy beat holding Bitcoin over its full test window; past copy-trading
  profits did not predict future ones (rank correlation 0.04 over 33,927 wallet-weeks).
